@startuml CaptivePortal
actor User
participant "WLAN Client" as Client
participant "ESP32 Webserver" as ESP
participant "Angular UI" as Angular

== Verbindung und Captive Portal ==
User -> Client: WLAN verbinden (AP-Modus)
Client -> ESP: HTTP-Request (z.B. /generate_204)
ESP -> Client: HTTP 302 Redirect (Location: /)
Client -> ESP: GET /
ESP -> Angular: Liefere Angular-UI (index.html)
Angular -> Client: UI wird angezeigt

== API-Kommunikation ==
User -> Angular: Bedienung UI
Angular -> ESP: API-Request (/api/...)
ESP --> Angular: API-Response (JSON)
@enduml
